`sysmon` EventCode=1
    (OriginalFileName="Apollo.exe"
     OR Hashes="*CEE7A80C476719D605855773227E6D102692DFBBB34D2110011A6B78BFCAC21A*")
| stats count min(_time) as first_seen max(_time) as last_seen by ComputerName, Image, OriginalFileName, ParentImage, CommandLine, User
| convert ctime(first_seen) ctime(last_seen)

```
Mythic Apollo Agent Detection
Author: fungiknight (Gabriel Lopez)
MITRE: T1071.001 (Application Layer Protocol: Web)

Detects execution of the Mythic C2 Apollo agent by
OriginalFileName or SHA256 hash. The OriginalFileName
field persists in the PE header even after renaming.
